// Wildcard use `only *` is intentionally not supported (spec/15): it hides
// provenance (names enter the scope bare, and the set changes silently as the
// source's exports change). Use a namespace import `use @Std/Io` (then
// `Io.print`) for broad access, or `only { … }` to select names. The parser must
// reject `only *`.
use @Std/Io only *

fn main() {
}
